{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I rushed into the room and found blood all over the floor. I thought I had made it on time. Our co-workers couldn't even hear what she was doing. The company failed her. The company failed all of us. Why did I not listen? How did I not see the signs?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything I've done and everything I've learned about her was all a front to make me believe she was happy. I wasn't supposed to be at home. I was supposed to be here, at work. I can't do this anymore. Please forgive me for this. I'll see you soon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638350/extras/c142b8ed7618ef49e6b542fa87aa516f.avif?t=1751631008\" width=616 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this shoot 'em up mini game, destroy all 33 white blocks without getting hit by any of the black blocks. You have the ability to warp  from one side of the field to the other,\u00a0vertically and horizontally. The bullets you shoot warp vertically, but only warp into the field once. The ability to warp yourself and the bullets could be handy in difficult situations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features Include:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Challenging Gameplay: Destroying all 33 memories isn't easy. One hit and its lights out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Completion Record: Every Survival Run completed is added to your Completed Runs score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Steam Leaderboards: Your total Completed Runs score is saved and ranked.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Butterfly","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3638350/689f3a97d128e1a2730d31f3fca96edcd584a6fb.jpg"},{"name":"Letter 51","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3638350/41551da917a9429e0580ede35368527da390847b.jpg"},{"name":"Strawberry Slice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3638350/9901bc071d9f90c59fbd51ed0e56636d10526faf.jpg"},{"name":"7 Personas","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3638350/dbd412438f71839e9d55e3b9feb0dc41b793a85f.jpg"},{"name":"No More Villains","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3638350/64e1f0720cc59aa4b63ac37d86ae66a97f2b0e50.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3638350?t=1751631008","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3638350?t=1751631008","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638350/f85e5a191eb311dfc7d4b925c30a9a01dabfd3dd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751631008","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638350/f85e5a191eb311dfc7d4b925c30a9a01dabfd3dd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751631008","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I rushed into the room and found blood all over the floor. I thought I had made it on time. Our co-workers couldn't even hear what she was doing. The company failed her. The company failed all of us. Why did I not listen? How did I not see the signs?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything I've done and everything I've learned about her was all a front to make me believe she was happy. I wasn't supposed to be at home. I was supposed to be here, at work. I can't do this anymore. Please forgive me for this. I'll see you soon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638350/extras/c142b8ed7618ef49e6b542fa87aa516f.avif?t=1751631008\" width=616 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this shoot 'em up mini game, destroy all 33 white blocks without getting hit by any of the black blocks. You have the ability to warp  from one side of the field to the other,\u00a0vertically and horizontally. The bullets you shoot warp vertically, but only warp into the field once. The ability to warp yourself and the bullets could be handy in difficult situations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features Include:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Challenging Gameplay: Destroying all 33 memories isn't easy. One hit and its lights out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Completion Record: Every Survival Run completed is added to your Completed Runs score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Steam Leaderboards: Your total Completed Runs score is saved and ranked.</p>","developers":["Butterfly"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638350/97f7397c95f64d39e0d4f5aa0756284db92b3200/header.jpg?t=1751631008","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3638350/884851/e5078fa515eb3be16b83b0e5a3cd3ab2957e4854/1750408593/dash_av1.mpd?t=1750292859","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3638350/884851/e5078fa515eb3be16b83b0e5a3cd3ab2957e4854/1750408593/dash_h264.mpd?t=1750292859","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3638350/884851/e5078fa515eb3be16b83b0e5a