 her. Something wasn't right in her mind. I focused and fought this as hard as I could but in the end, no matter the result, nothing good would happen. I should've been there and now I ask her to forgive me.","steam_appid":3638350,"support_info":{"email":"batafuraicorporation@gmail.com","url":"https://www.facebook.com/BatafuraiCorporation"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}